sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as HTTP handler and DTO
    participant S as Order service
    participant R as Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    C->>H: POST /orders + JWT + Idempotency-Key
    H->>H: Validate authentication and request
    H->>S: CreateOrder(user, items, key)
    S->>R: Begin transaction and serialize key
    S->>R: Read server prices and reserve stock
    alt Matching existing key
        R-->>H: Return original order
        H-->>C: 200 OK
    else New valid order
        R->>DB: Insert order, items and movement audit
        R->>DB: Commit transaction
        H-->>C: 201 Created
    else Conflict or write failure
        R->>DB: Roll back all writes
        H-->>C: 409 Conflict or error
    end
